---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import { projectContact } from '../lib/contact';
import '../styles/visitor.css';
---
<SiteLayout title="Talk about an idea | Contact Fidret" description="An early idea or an unsolved problem is enough. Tell Hadi what is happening and what you would like to change. No finished brief needed." canonical="https://fidret.com/contact/">
  <main id="main" tabindex="-1">
    <header class="visitor-hero shell">
      <h1>Tell us what you have in mind.</h1>
      <p class="visitor-lead">An early idea or an unsolved problem is enough.</p>
      <p>Tell Hadi what is happening and what you would like to change. You do not need a finished brief.</p>
      <a class="button" href={projectContact.destination}>{projectContact.destinationLabel}</a>
      <p class="contact-destination">{projectContact.note}</p>
    </header>
    <section class="contact-preparation shell" aria-labelledby="context-title">
      <div><h2 id="context-title">Start wherever you are.</h2><p>A process that keeps going wrong, a possibility you want to explore, or a question about the work here.</p></div>
      <details class="visitor-disclosure"><summary>Useful details, if you have them</summary><ul><li>One example of what happens today.</li><li>What you hope could be different.</li><li>The people involved or any constraints you already know.</li><li>A link to the project that prompted your question.</li></ul></details>
    </section>
    <section class="visitor-split shell">
      <h2>Find a useful next step.</h2>
      <div><p>A conversation can help us decide whether there is something useful to investigate together. The right next step might be a smaller question, an experiment or a different approach.</p><div class="visitor-actions"><a class="text-link" href="/approach/">How we approach a project</a><a class="text-link" href="/people/hadi/">About Hadi</a></div></div>
    </section>
  </main>
</SiteLayout>
